# Journal Entries Directory

This directory is reserved for journal entry files.

## Structure

Each entry can be stored as:
- `entry-slug.html` - Static HTML entry (current approach)
- `entry-slug.md` - Markdown entry (future support)

## Naming Convention

Use lowercase with hyphens:
- `2026-07-13-first-moss-collection.html`
- `the-philosophy-of-stones.md`

## Entry Format (HTML)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Entry Title — ROUZHEN Journal</title>
  <!-- Shared styles -->
</head>
<body>
  <article class="entry">
    <header class="entry-header">
      <time datetime="2026-07-13">2026.07.13</time>
      <h1>Entry Title</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="entry-content">
      <!-- Entry content -->
    </div>
    <footer class="entry-footer">
      <!-- Tags, navigation -->
    </footer>
  </article>
</body>
</html>
```

## Future: Markdown Support

Planned workflow:
1. Write in Markdown
2. Build process converts to HTML
3. Metadata stored in data/entries.json